{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526224",
      "title": "More on Slots",
      "lectureOrder": 117,
      "videoOrder": 100,
      "sourceHash": "754b0bf5c5298e95140c16bf8bada8b9fd115f32c10573f93be4e7018982902e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.14,
          "end": 5.1,
          "en": "So, slots clearly are an important feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.1,
          "end": 7.66,
          "en": "They give us way more flexibility",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.66,
          "end": 9.41,
          "en": "and allow us to do things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.41,
          "end": 10.74,
          "en": "which we can't really do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.74,
          "end": 13.57,
          "en": "or which we can't really built without slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.57,
          "end": 15.78,
          "en": "Now, I'm not done with slots still,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.78,
          "end": 18.22,
          "en": "there's more we can cover about them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.22,
          "end": 22.15,
          "en": "For example, you can't provide default slot content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.15,
          "end": 23.36,
          "en": "So, with that I don't mean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.36,
          "end": 26.84,
          "en": "that you have a default and unnamed slot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.84,
          "end": 28.71,
          "en": "where content will go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.71,
          "end": 30.82,
          "en": "that doesn't target a different name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.82,
          "end": 33.21,
          "en": "but I mean that if you have a slot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.21,
          "end": 35.58,
          "en": "which receives no content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.58,
          "end": 39.53,
          "en": "that this slot can then render some default content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.53,
          "end": 42.32,
          "en": "for example, here in the header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.32,
          "end": 44.01,
          "en": "we can add default content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.01,
          "end": 45.28,
          "en": "by adding content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 45.28,
          "end": 47.98,
          "en": "between our slots tags here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 47.98,
          "end": 51.05,
          "en": "Let's say h2 tag here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51.05,
          "end": 53.13,
          "en": "where I say The Default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 53.13,
          "end": 54.903,
          "en": "just to show how this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 56.18,
          "end": 57.54,
          "en": "It does make a lot of sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.54,
          "end": 59.28,
          "en": "for this specific component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.28,
          "end": 61.39,
          "en": "but you definitely can have components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 61.39,
          "end": 64.86,
          "en": "where some default content might make sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 64.86,
          "end": 66.65,
          "en": "Now, if you add such an element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 66.65,
          "end": 67.89,
          "en": "if you add content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 67.89,
          "end": 69.85,
          "en": "between your slots tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 69.85,
          "end": 73.78,
          "en": "by default this will not be visible right now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 73.78,
          "end": 75.67,
          "en": "because all the places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 75.67,
          "end": 77.63,
          "en": "where I use the base card",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 77.63,
          "end": 80.61,
          "en": "do provide content for the header slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 80.61,
          "end": 82.18,
          "en": "Both the badge list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 82.18,
          "end": 84.38,
          "en": "as well as the user info component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 84.38,
          "end": 87.303,
          "en": "both provide content for the header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 88.68,
          "end": 90.12,
          "en": "But let's say the badge list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 90.12,
          "end": 93.87,
          "en": "wouldn't have it's v-slot header template here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 93.87,
          "end": 95.93,
          "en": "So, it doesn't provide any content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 95.93,
          "end": 97.12299999999999,
          "en": "for the header slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 98.36,
          "end": 99.95,
          "en": "If you remove that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 99.95,
          "end": 103.71000000000001,
          "en": "you see now The Default in that component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 103.71000000000001,
          "end": 107.03,
          "en": "because now the slot fallback content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 107.03,
          "end": 110.22999999999999,
          "en": "the default content of that slot is being shown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 110.22999999999999,
          "end": 113.763,
          "en": "And that of course can be useful for certain components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 115.13,
          "end": 116.05,
          "en": "Now we can argue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 116.05,
          "end": 119.24000000000001,
          "en": "if it's useful for this specific component though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 119.24000000000001,
          "end": 120.82,
          "en": "Why should a card",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 120.82,
          "end": 123.51,
          "en": "which should just act as a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 123.51,
          "end": 125.84,
          "en": "that gives us some visual styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 125.84,
          "end": 128.76,
          "en": "why should that have a default title?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 128.76,
          "end": 131.29,
          "en": "After all, you don't know what the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 131.29,
          "end": 134.29,
          "en": "that will be passed into the card will be about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 134.29,
          "end": 137.01,
          "en": "So, rendering some default title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 137.01,
          "end": 139.083,
          "en": "probably does make a lot of sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 140.03,
          "end": 142.02,
          "en": "I'll still leave it here for reference,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 142.02,
          "end": 144.6,
          "en": "but of course it is just an example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 144.6,
          "end": 146.73,
          "en": "But you can in such cases",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 146.73,
          "end": 149.11,
          "en": "where you don't know if you really need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 149.11,
          "end": 151.18,
          "en": "that slot element here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 151.18,
          "end": 153.953,
          "en": "you can also use another nice feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 155.41,
          "end": 159.12,
          "en": "If we wouldn't render this default fallback content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 159.12,
          "end": 162.72,
          "en": "our badge list card doesn't have any title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 162.72,
          "end": 165.1,
          "en": "But if we inspect the HTML markup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 165.1,
          "end": 169.25,
          "en": "we of course see it has an empty header element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 169.25,
          "end": 171.81,
          "en": "And whilst we don't see it on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 171.81,
          "end": 174.27,
          "en": "this is not ideal semantically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 174.27,
          "end": 176.5,
          "en": "having an empty HTML element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 176.5,
          "end": 178.21,
          "en": "lying around in the Dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 178.21,
          "end": 181.01,
          "en": "I don't know, I don't want to have that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 181.01,
          "end": 183.61,
          "en": "You can utilize another cool feature here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 183.61,
          "end": 187.16,
          "en": "In the component where you define slots,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 187.16,
          "end": 191.7,
          "en": "you get a special property provided by vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 191.7,
          "end": 195.41,
          "en": "We can see it if I add the mounted lifecycle here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 195.41,
          "end": 197.24,
          "en": "Let's then console log,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 197.24,
          "end": 200.29,
          "en": "this dollar sign slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 200.29,
          "end": 201.54,
          "en": "Dollar sign slots",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 201.54,
          "end": 204.95,
          "en": "is a number built in property provided by vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 204.95,
          "end": 206.82999999999998,
          "en": "And it holds information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 206.82999999999998,
          "end": 208.81,
          "en": "about the slot data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 208.81,
          "end": 212.573,
          "en": "this component receives for its different slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 213.8,
          "end": 215.46,
          "en": "So, if I save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 215.46,
          "end": 216.71,
          "en": "open the developer tool",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 216.71,
          "end": 219.45,
          "en": "and DARE to JavaScript console and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 219.45,
          "end": 222.63,
          "en": "we see queue console logs here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 222.63,
          "end": 224.03,
          "en": "Why do we see two?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 224.03,
          "end": 228.05,
          "en": "Because we're using our component that has slots twice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 228.05,
          "end": 229.95,
          "en": "We're using it in user info",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 229.95,
          "end": 232.43,
          "en": "and we're using it in badge list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 232.43,
          "end": 233.82999999999998,
          "en": "So, every time this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 233.82999999999998,
          "end": 234.71,
          "en": "is getting used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 234.71,
          "end": 236.32,
          "en": "mounted is getting called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 236.32,
          "end": 237.97,
          "en": "because this base card component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 237.97,
          "end": 240.91,
          "en": "gets created and mounted twice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 240.91,
          "end": 242.91,
          "en": "Obviously, since we use it twice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 242.91,
          "end": 246.27,
          "en": "and therefore we get this console log twice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 246.27,
          "end": 248.17,
          "en": "Now, the interesting thing is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 248.17,
          "end": 250.29,
          "en": "in those objects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 250.29,
          "end": 253.92,
          "en": "we have access to the different slots we're providing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 253.92,
          "end": 256.89,
          "en": "So, we can actually access dot header here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 256.89,
          "end": 259.42,
          "en": "because we have a slot named header here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 259.42,
          "end": 261.68,
          "en": "We could also access dot default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 261.68,
          "end": 263.313,
          "en": "because we have a default slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 264.54,
          "end": 266.23,
          "en": "Now, if I access dot header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 266.23,
          "end": 268.44,
          "en": "we'll see something interesting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 268.44,
          "end": 269.65,
          "en": "If I reload again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 269.65,
          "end": 271.82,
          "en": "we also see two outputs in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 271.82,
          "end": 273.81,
          "en": "this one and this one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 273.81,
          "end": 275.36,
          "en": "and we see two outputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 275.36,
          "end": 277.55,
          "en": "for the same reason as explained before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 277.55,
          "end": 279.05,
          "en": "But the interesting thing is that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 279.05,
          "end": 282.12,
          "en": "we see this strange output here once,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 282.12,
          "end": 285.39,
          "en": "but that we see undefined the other time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 285.39,
          "end": 287.26,
          "en": "Now, undefined here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 287.26,
          "end": 289.04,
          "en": "is coming from the usage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 289.04,
          "end": 290.73,
          "en": "of the base card component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 290.73,
          "end": 292.76,
          "en": "in the badge list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 292.76,
          "end": 294.88,
          "en": "There we're not providing content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 294.88,
          "end": 296.23,
          "en": "for the header slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 296.23,
          "end": 298.39,
          "en": "And therefore in base card component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 298.39,
          "end": 302.56,
          "en": "when I try to access this provided content, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 302.56,
          "end": 305.6,
          "en": "I get undefined when this base card component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 305.6,
          "end": 308.21,
          "en": "gets created for the badge list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 308.21,
          "end": 311.07,
          "en": "And now that's something we can utilize here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 311.07,
          "end": 312.72,
          "en": "On this header element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 312.72,
          "end": 314.59,
          "en": "we could add v-if",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 314.59,
          "end": 318.99,
          "en": "and check if slots header is truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 318.99,
          "end": 320.25,
          "en": "So, if it's undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 320.25,
          "end": 321.52,
          "en": "it will be falsy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 321.52,
          "end": 323.32,
          "en": "and therefore this header element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 323.32,
          "end": 324.533,
          "en": "will not be rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 326.341,
          "end": 328.36,
          "en": "So if I now save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 328.36,
          "end": 329.8,
          "en": "we get the same log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 329.8,
          "end": 332.44,
          "en": "But if I inspect this badge list component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 332.44,
          "end": 334.8,
          "en": "you now see the header is gone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 335.76,
          "end": 338.9,
          "en": "and that's just of course, a minor improvement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 338.9,
          "end": 341.40999999999997,
          "en": "It's also definitely a bit more advanced,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
